solute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #888;\n    margin-top: auto;\n    padding-top: 20px;\n  }\n  sup {\n    font-size: 0.65em;\n    vertical-align: super;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1 class=\"title\">Why Linux Containers (LXC)</h1>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Logo: IBM]</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <ul class=\"main-list\">\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"main-text\">Fast</span>\n          <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>Runtime performance near bare metal speeds</li>\n            <li>Management operations (run, stop , start, etc.) in seconds / milliseconds</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"main-text\">Agile</span>\n          <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>VM-like agility – it’s still “virtualization”</li>\n            <li>Seamlessly “migrate” between virtual and bare metal environments</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"main-text\">Flexible</span>\n          <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>Containerize a “system”</li>\n            <li>Containerize “application(s)”</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"main-text\">Lightweight</span>\n          <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>Just enough Operating System (JeOS)</li>\n            <li>Minimal per container penalty</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"main-text\">Inexpensive</span>\n          <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>Open source – free – lower TCO</li>\n            <li>Supported with out-of-the-box modern Linux kernel</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <span class=\"main-text\">Ecosystem</span>\n          <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n            <li>Growing in popularity</li>\n            <li>Vibrant community & numerous 3<sup>rd</sup> party apps</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <div>5/11/2014</div>\n      <div>Document v2.0</div>\n      <div>5</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
